:\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"constructor\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"IsPaused\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"NotOwner\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"Reentrant\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"UsdtTransferFailed\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"ZeroAddress\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"ZeroAmount\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"depositor\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"xodeBeneficiary\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"usdtAmount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"depositNonce\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"Deposited\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"previousOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"OwnerTransferred\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"paused\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"name\":\"PausedSet\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"to\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"Withdrawn\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"usdtAmount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"xodeBeneficiary\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"deposit\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"depositNonce\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"owner\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"paused\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"paused_\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"name\":\"setPaused\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"transferOwnership\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"usdt\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract IERC20\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"to\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"withdraw\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{},\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"deposit(uint256,address)\":{\"notice\":\"Deposits `usdtAmount` USDT (requires a prior `usdt.approve(address(this), usdtAmount)`) and records `xodeBeneficiary` as who should receive the resulting XON on Xode. The relayer picks this up from the `Deposited` event and pays out for its `usdtAmount` - which is what actually arrived in this contract, not what was asked for, so a token that takes a fee on transfer (Ethereum USDT has a fee switch, currently off) can never be paid out above what the gateway really holds.\"}},\"notice\":\"Deployed on Ethereum (not Xode). Accepts real USDT from a depositor who wants XON on Xode in return, and records which Xode address (`xodeBeneficiary`) should receive it - there is no cross-chain callback here, so a separate relayer service watches `Deposited` events on this contract and calls `XonVendingMachine.settleExternalPurchase` on Xode to actually pay out. This contract is a custodial escrow, not a bridge: USDT deposited here just sits in this contract's balance under `owner`'s control (via `withdraw`) until manually moved - there is no on-chain mechanism connecting Ethereum and Xode (Xode has no live Snowbridge connection as of writing). The XON payout on Xode is entirely a promise kept by whoever runs the relayer and controls `owner`/`relayer` here and the corresponding `relayer` role on `XonVendingMachine` - securing those keys (and this contract's `owner` key, which can drain the whole USDT balance) is the actual security boundary of this leg, not this contract's code.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/ethereum/EthUsdtGateway.sol\":\"EthUsdtGateway\"},\"evmVersion\":\"cancun\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\"]},\"sources\":{\"src/ethereum/EthUsdtGateway.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x5ec9852d67b894a15985d01784c7c36e032b2dc3fdf83e34c6d05489fbd0f65b\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://adfd7bd098afe1852c1c2dee70c3ea23f7cb0bc3cccc6794adc9c1f61373957a\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmQDTSKWgEzgPrBQEsprmexKVG7tPxSK1MPW9wZUA2DeJ7\"]},\"src/interfaces/IERC20.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x311bc8e76659b8003b582a1493843da9b42dde90dcf11e05cb91cb9ccbf3f208\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://f8dc24b42c9d5a029fbeeee8f5850cef9132beae135fba84e79961bb185cead4\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmPi2GVAVZqkgC1HFQJWavZ4TCSs6TMhEgU2xhnjsQeiFh\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.24+commit.e11b9ed9"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"usdtToken","type":"address"},{"internalType":"address","name":"owner_","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"constructor"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"IsPaused"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error